sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Dijkstra
    participant SearchImpl as shortest_path_search_impl

    Note over Client, SearchImpl: Dijkstra Search Implementation (Early Termination)<br/>Graph: %{:a => [{7, :b}, {9, :c}], :b => [{2, :c}], :c => []}<br/>Find shortest path from :a to :c

    %% Initial call
    Client->>+Dijkstra: shortest_path_search(graph, :a, :c)
    
    Note over Dijkstra: Initialize routes: [{0, [:a]}]<br/>Initialize visited: %{}
    
    %% Start search implementation
    Dijkstra->>+SearchImpl: shortest_path_search_impl(graph, [{0, [:a]}], :c, %{})
    
    %% ITERATION 1: Process node :a (cost 0, path [:a])
    Note over SearchImpl: **ITERATION 1**<br/>Routes: [{0, [:a]}]<br/>Extract: {0, [:a]}<br/>Current node: :a, Destination: :c (not reached)
    
    Note over SearchImpl: Get neighbors of :a from graph<br/>Neighbors: [{7, :b}, {9, :c}]
    
    Note over SearchImpl: Build new routes for unvisited neighbors:<br/>:b not visited: {0+7, [:b, :a]} = {7, [:b, :a]}<br/>:c not visited: {0+9, [:c, :a]} = {9, [:c, :a]}
    
    Note over SearchImpl: Mark :a as visited<br/>New routes: [{7, [:b, :a]}, {9, [:c, :a]}]
    
    SearchImpl->>+SearchImpl: shortest_path_search_impl(graph, [{7, [:b, :a]}, {9, [:c, :a]}], :c, %{:a => true})
    
    %% ITERATION 2: Process node :b (cost 7, path [:b, :a])
    Note over SearchImpl: **ITERATION 2**<br/>Sort routes: [{7, [:b, :a]}, {9, [:c, :a]}]<br/>Extract: {7, [:b, :a]}<br/>Current node: :b, Destination: :c (not reached)
    
    Note over SearchImpl: Get neighbors of :b from graph<br/>Neighbors: [{2, :c}]
    
    Note over SearchImpl: Build new routes for unvisited neighbors:<br/>:c not visited: {7+2, [:c, :b, :a]} = {9, [:c, :b, :a]}
    
    Note over SearchImpl: Mark :b as visited<br/>New routes: [{9, [:c, :a]}, {9, [:c, :b, :a]}]
    
    SearchImpl->>+SearchImpl: shortest_path_search_impl(graph, [{9, [:c, :a]}, {9, [:c, :b, :a]}], :c, %{:a => true, :b => true})
    
    %% ITERATION 3: Process node :c (cost 9, path [:c, :a]) - DESTINATION REACHED!
    Note over SearchImpl: **ITERATION 3 - DESTINATION FOUND!**<br/>Sort routes: [{9, [:c, :a]}, {9, [:c, :b, :a]}]<br/>Extract: {9, [:c, :a]}<br/>Current node: :c, Destination: :c ✓ MATCH!
    
    Note over SearchImpl: **EARLY TERMINATION**<br/>Destination reached!<br/>Reverse path: [:c, :a] → [:a, :c]<br/>Return: {9, [:a, :c]}
    
    SearchImpl-->>-SearchImpl: {9, [:a, :c]}
    SearchImpl-->>-SearchImpl: {9, [:a, :c]}
    SearchImpl-->>-Dijkstra: {9, [:a, :c]}
    
    %% Final result
    Dijkstra-->>-Client: {9, [:a, :c]}
    
    Note over Client: **RESULT**<br/>Cost = 9 (direct path :a → :c)<br/>Path = [:a, :c]<br/>**Early termination avoided exploring :a → :b → :c (cost 9)**
